  "headline": "Linezolid is not on FDA's shortage list; internal supply imbalance shows Corvale East at 5.3 days on hand versus Corvale General at 24 days",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show linezolid is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 76 tablets of the 600 mg presentation with a daily use of 14.4, giving 5.3 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 387 tablets of the same presentation with a daily use of 16.1, giving 24 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both sites' product carries NDC 67877041920 labeled by Ascend Laboratories, LLC and linked to SPL set 7402aa01.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That SPL set names Alkem Laboratories Limited (FEI 3006370524) as the registered manufacturing plant.",
      "cites": ["E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection history for that plant shows VAI classifications in 2011, 2013, 2016, and 2018 with no OAI or recent NAI posted.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The ranked transfer option moves 127 tablets from Corvale General to Corvale East, leaving the sender above two weeks and bringing the receiver to 14 days.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
